/ Stage 4 (ruling 8): the builder offers kinded types by name. `set %n% = "1.5" as decimal`
/ builds Type=decimal and lands %n% whose type.name is "decimal". Red today — the baseline
/ measurement is `number` 5/5, so the builder drops the kind; %n!type.name% reads "number".
AsDecimalKeepsDecimal
- set %n% = "1.5" as decimal
- assert.equals(Expected="decimal", Actual=%n!type.name%, Message="type.name is decimal, not number")
